  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for ffmpeg-4",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for ffmpeg-4 fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in ffmpeg-4:\n\n- CVE-2026-64835: Out-of-Bounds Memory Access in ADX Audio Decoder (bsc#1272758)\n- CVE-2026-64832: Double-Free in NVDEC Hardware Decoder via nvdec.c (bsc#1272754)\n- CVE-2026-64830: Heap Buffer Overflow via VobSub Subtitle Demuxer (bsc#1272752)\n- CVE-2026-66038: LCL/ZLIB Video Decoder Information Disclosure via lcldec.c (bsc#1272768)\n- CVE-2026-66039: MACE6 Audio Decoder Heap Out-of-Bounds Write via CAF File (bsc#1272765)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
